{"version":2,"sourceHash":"8ba562241517e1e324fbb5326f4ec69210a15b0a6dae5c333b57fe04c2e0c36e","locale":"zh-CN","id":"ep-05","no":"EP.05","tag":"第5话 · 与我相同，站在我这边","title":"与我相同，站在我这边","beats":[{"s":"n","bg":"islandIn","bgm":"neo","l":{"who":"yeon"},"c":{"who":"neo"},"r":{"who":"mirror"},"t":"镜之回廊的空气沉了下来。刚从亥水深渊出来，好不容易才把湿身子弄干，眼前镜中的Yeoni却缓缓举起了手。","id":"ep-05:1","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","fx":"veil","t":"无数镜片浮在她身后，每一片都映着不同的Yeoni。","id":"ep-05:2","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"veil","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","t":"生气的Yeoni，放弃的Yeoni，与别人比较的Yeoni，装没事笑着的Yeoni，一脸什么也做不了的Yeoni。","id":"ep-05:3"},{"s":"n","t":"以及望着这些自己、露出厌倦表情的另一个Yeoni。","id":"ep-05:4"},{"s":"yeon","x":"grin","t":"哇，我发行的版本比想象中多啊。怎么也不整理一下更新。","id":"ep-05:5"},{"s":"neo","x":"talk","t":"这是比劫之岛的最后一场试炼。","id":"ep-05:6"},{"s":"yeon","x":"grin","t":"至少告诉我考试名称吧。死也让我有个心理准备。","id":"ep-05:7"},{"s":"n","im":true,"t":"那一瞬间，文字浮在回廊中央。","id":"ep-05:8","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"s":"sys","im":true,"t":"[ 比劫之岛 · 最终试炼 ]\n[ 分辨与你相同的面孔。 ]\n[ 与比肩为伴，斩断劫财。 ]","id":"ep-05:9","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 시스템 메시지"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"s":"yeon","x":"surprise","t":"等等。没有新手教程，难度怎么突然变这样？","id":"ep-05:10"},{"s":"neo","x":"lecture","t":"相同的气支持你时，呈现比肩的面貌；觊觎你的份额时，呈现劫财的面貌。这里要你亲眼看出区别。","id":"ep-05:11"},{"s":"yeon","x":"think","t":"所以脸都和我一样，可一个是同伴，一个是想骗走我位置的家伙，对吧？","id":"ep-05:12"},{"s":"neo","x":"talk","t":"没错。可两者都是你的脸，别被外表骗了。","id":"ep-05:13"},{"s":"yeon","x":"grin","t":"哇，这游戏真新颖。敌人和队友用同一个皮肤。怎么不加个防误伤系统。","id":"ep-05:14"},{"s":"n","t":"Yeoni扫视那些镜片，全是自己的脸，全是自己的表情。喉咙发干，到底要靠什么区分。","id":"ep-05:15"},{"s":"geo","t":"不会那么容易哦？","id":"ep-05:16"},{"s":"n","fx":"veil","t":"镜中的Yeoni轻轻打了个响指。啪。","id":"ep-05:17","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"veil","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","bgm":"crisis","t":"最先走出来的是满脸怒气的Yeoni。她双手抱胸，脚尖点着地，瞪着这边。","id":"ep-05:18","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","t":"“你总是忍着，之后才在莫名其妙的地方爆发。”","id":"ep-05:19"},{"s":"yeon","x":"surprise","t":"喂，开场台词就用大实话打人，犯规了吧。","id":"ep-05:20"},{"s":"n","t":"“不喜欢，当场说不喜欢就好。偏要装没事，回家才一个人踢被子。”","id":"ep-05:21"},{"s":"yeon","x":"grin","t":"别说了。我刚在深渊灌了一肚子水出来，心理状态还湿漉漉的。","id":"ep-05:22"},{"s":"n","t":"“所以，又想用笑话盖过去？”Yeoni闭上了嘴，反驳卡在喉间。","id":"ep-05:23"},{"s":"n","fx":"ink","t":"趁着这片语塞的空隙，愤怒的Yeoni脚下，黑色镜片像尖刺般长了出来。","id":"ep-05:24","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"ink","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"neo","x":"talk","t":"小心，现在她想连你的份也拿走。","id":"ep-05:25"},{"s":"yeon","x":"think","t":"她不是我这边的吗？刚才说的都是对的啊。","id":"ep-05:26"},{"s":"neo","x":"lecture","t":"用正确的话逼迫你，想代替你占据你的位置，那就是劫财。","id":"ep-05:27"},{"s":"n","fx":"claw","t":"愤怒的Yeoni笑得尖锐。“所以我替你说吧，反正你也做不到。”","id":"ep-05:28","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"claw","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","t":"红色玻璃碎片从她指尖像箭一样飞来，Yeongnyangi跃起挡在前面。锵！","id":"ep-05:29"},{"s":"neo","x":"serious","t":"Yeoni，清醒一点！","id":"ep-05:30"},{"s":"yeon","x":"surprise","t":"知道了，我知道了！","id":"ep-05:31"},{"s":"n","t":"Yeoni把前蹄稳稳踩在地上。[乙]的暖意从胸中升起，脚下冒出绿藤。","id":"ep-05:32"},{"s":"n","t":"愤怒的Yeoni却没有停。“你总是晚。发火晚，开口晚，连决定都慢一拍。”","id":"ep-05:33"},{"s":"n","bg":"islandIn","tone":"desat","t":"Yeoni咬紧牙。正因为说得没错，才更疼，心口灼热地绷紧。","id":"ep-05:34","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","bg":"islandIn","t":"可唯独这次，不想转身逃跑。","id":"ep-05:35","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"yeon","x":"calm","t":"……没错，我经常事后才爆发，不否认。","id":"ep-05:36"},{"s":"n","t":"愤怒的Yeoni眼神一晃，像是没料到会听见这个回答。","id":"ep-05:37"},{"s":"yeon","x":"talk","t":"可我不想让你代替我爆发。","id":"ep-05:38"},{"s":"n","t":"“……为什么。”","id":"ep-05:39"},{"s":"yeon","x":"talk","t":"那又不是我说的话。声音是出来了，可我自己不在里面啊。","id":"ep-05:40"},{"s":"n","t":"Yeoni迎着红色碎片飞来的方向，向前踏了一步。","id":"ep-05:41"},{"s":"yeon","im":true,"x":"talk","t":"生气不是坏事。但夺走我的嘴，替我大喊，那可不是站在我这边。","id":"ep-05:42","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"s":"n","t":"红色玻璃碎片在空中摇晃，失去速度。","id":"ep-05:43"},{"s":"yeon","x":"gentle","t":"你可以成为我的同伴。但让我消失的方式，恕不接受。","id":"ep-05:44"},{"s":"n","t":"愤怒的Yeoni神情僵住，脚下黑色碎片悄然融化消失。红光像收起尖刺般柔和下来。","id":"ep-05:45"},{"s":"n","t":"“那……就别光忍着。”愤怒的Yeoni轻声低语。","id":"ep-05:46"},{"s":"yeon","x":"soft","t":"嗯。下次我会当场说，免得回家踢被子。我会练习。","id":"ep-05:47"},{"s":"n","fx":"veil","t":"愤怒的Yeoni散成红光，化为一块小小的红镜片，静静贴在Yeoni身旁。","id":"ep-05:48","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"veil","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"neo","x":"soft","t":"转为比肩了，你多了一个同伴。","id":"ep-05:49"},{"s":"yeon","x":"excited","t":"哦，我刚抓到第一只宝可梦？感觉像扔了个精灵球。","id":"ep-05:50"},{"s":"n","t":"兴奋地挥动前蹄时，扁鼻孔自己喷出一口气。哼唧。一缕白雾在回廊凝起，又散开。","id":"ep-05:51"},{"s":"neo","x":"deadpan","t":"……别这样理解。","id":"ep-05:52"},{"s":"neo","x":"deadpan","t":"不是宝可梦。它们不会逃跑，也不会进化。","id":"ep-05:53"},{"s":"yeon","x":"grin","t":"可这样理解，我突然觉得能行了啊。","id":"ep-05:54"},{"s":"n","bg":"islandIn","bgm":"gloom","tone":"desat","t":"接着出现的是一脸放弃的Yeoni。不，她没有走过来，只坐在地上抬起头，眼神空空的。","id":"ep-05:55","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","t":"“不做也没关系，反正又会失败。”","id":"ep-05:56"},{"s":"n","t":"Yeoni的心沉了一截。那声音太熟悉了。还没开始就已疲惫的心，害怕期待之后更痛，先把希望收起的那些夜晚。","id":"ep-05:57"},{"s":"n","t":"“你也知道，期待多少，就会累多少。”","id":"ep-05:58"},{"s":"yeon","x":"calm","t":"……嗯，知道。深有体会。","id":"ep-05:59"},{"s":"n","fx":"ink","t":"“所以，放下就好。”灰色镜片在她周围缓缓浮起，每一片都映着Yeoni放弃的瞬间。","id":"ep-05:60","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"ink","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","t":"在提交按钮前关掉的申请表，写好又删掉的消息，凌晨装作无所谓、把屏幕倒扣的指尖。","id":"ep-05:61"},{"s":"n","t":"“没有期待，就没有失望。”这话奇异地甜，像承诺不再让人受伤。Yeoni的脚尖有一瞬往后退。","id":"ep-05:62"},{"s":"n","bg":"islandIn","t":"这时，头顶花朵下蓝色水纹流转。是[亥]的气息。深水，沉下去也终究不会消失的心。","id":"ep-05:63","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"yeon","x":"calm","t":"可是我……为了不失望提前放弃，真的有过好多次。","id":"ep-05:64"},{"s":"n","t":"放弃的Yeoni缓缓抬头。","id":"ep-05:65"},{"s":"yeon","x":"calm","t":"那时确实轻松了，只在那一瞬间。","id":"ep-05:66"},{"s":"n","t":"灰色镜片如水波摇动。","id":"ep-05:67"},{"s":"yeon","x":"talk","t":"试过之后搞砸，难过几天就过去了。没试就算了的事，却跟着我好几年，晚上只要躺下就会想起来。","id":"ep-05:68"},{"s":"n","t":"放弃的Yeoni表情扭曲。“……可是还是害怕啊。”","id":"ep-05:69"},{"s":"yeon","x":"calm","t":"嗯，现在也怕，前蹄都在抖。","id":"ep-05:70"},{"s":"yeon","x":"talk","t":"但我不愿意你因为害怕，就替我把选择收起来。真要放下，也要由我亲手来。","id":"ep-05:71"},{"s":"n","t":"灰色镜片一片片失去力量，落了下来。“那……真的很累时怎么办？”","id":"ep-05:72"},{"s":"yeon","x":"soft","t":"那就休息。","id":"ep-05:73"},{"s":"n","t":"“……不是放弃？”","id":"ep-05:74"},{"s":"yeon","x":"gentle","t":"嗯。休息和放弃，我们从现在开始，分清楚吧。","id":"ep-05:75"},{"s":"n","fx":"veil","t":"放弃的Yeoni默默望了许久，然后很慢很慢地点头。灰光变成银光，一块小银片飞来，停在Yeoni身旁。","id":"ep-05:76","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"veil","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"neo","x":"calm","t":"第二个比肩。","id":"ep-05:77"},{"s":"yeon","x":"grin","t":"第二个……这是集满十个就有赠品的集章卡吗？","id":"ep-05:78"},{"s":"yeon","x":"grin","t":"这真是考试？我现在感觉像在做付费心理咨询。","id":"ep-05:79"},{"s":"neo","x":"talk","t":"比劫之岛，是整理你内在同类之气的地方。","id":"ep-05:80"},{"s":"yeon","x":"grin","t":"那把服务名称改温和点。刚才简直是心理健身房私教课，我连会费都没交。","id":"ep-05:81"},{"s":"neo","x":"deadpan","t":"不用会费。但也不能中途离开。","id":"ep-05:82"},{"s":"n","bgm":"crisis","t":"这时，镜中的Yeoni拍手。啪，啪，啪。缓慢的三下。","id":"ep-05:83","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"geo","t":"真感人，差点落泪了。","id":"ep-05:84"},{"s":"geo","t":"不过，你真以为他们全都能成为你的同伴？","id":"ep-05:85"},{"s":"n","fx":"ink","t":"这次，数十块镜片一起涌到前方。比较的Yeoni，嫉妒的Yeoni，勉强笑的Yeoni，贬低自己的Yeoni。","id":"ep-05:86","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"ink","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","t":"“她做得那么好，你为什么不行？”“装没事，别破坏气氛。”“你本来就没运气。”“别期待。”“随便出头，只会更丢人。”","id":"ep-05:87"},{"s":"n","t":"声音同时从四面倾泻。Yeoni想捂住耳朵，可前蹄圆钝，声音全从缝里钻进来。","id":"ep-05:88"},{"s":"yeon","x":"surprise","t":"啊，够了！这根本是凌晨三点的群聊通知啊！","id":"ep-05:89"},{"s":"yeon","x":"surprise","t":"不能静音，也没有退出按钮，这完全是强制参与！","id":"ep-05:90"},{"s":"geo","t":"当然，因为全都是你。","id":"ep-05:91"},{"s":"n","bg":"islandIn","fx":"ink","tone":"dark","t":"声音越涨越大。“比较。”“藏起来。”“放弃。”“笑着带过。”“你的位置，从一开始就不存在。”","id":"ep-05:92","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"ink","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","t":"Yeoni头顶的花摇摇欲坠，[乙]的绿光变淡，连[亥]的水波也泛起黑色。","id":"ep-05:93"},{"s":"n","fx":"claw","t":"Yeongnyangi挡在前面斩开碎片。锵，锵，锵。可碎片增加得比斩除的速度更快。","id":"ep-05:94","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"claw","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"neo","x":"serious","t":"Yeoni，别一个一个应付！会被埋住的！","id":"ep-05:95"},{"s":"yeon","x":"surprise","t":"那要怎么办！全都是我的脸，我根本不知道从哪下手！","id":"ep-05:96"},{"s":"neo","x":"serious","t":"定个标准！","id":"ep-05:97"},{"s":"yeon","x":"surprise","t":"标准？什么标准！","id":"ep-05:98"},{"s":"neo","x":"serious","t":"守护你的声音，与夺走你的声音。就凭这一点区分！","id":"ep-05:99"},{"s":"n","bg":"islandIn","t":"Yeoni屏息。守护与夺走的声音。这两个词在脑中像锁扣般咬合。","id":"ep-05:100","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","t":"那一刻，看似相同的镜片，开始显出些微不同。","id":"ep-05:101"},{"s":"n","t":"愤怒的Yeoni，其实在喊：说出来吧。放弃的Yeoni，其实在低语：休息一下也可以。","id":"ep-05:102"},{"s":"n","bg":"islandIn","tone":"dark","t":"可比较的Yeoni，不断把Yeoni剪得更小。勉强笑的Yeoni，把Yeoni从原地抹去。自贬的Yeoni，悄悄腾空了Yeoni的椅子。","id":"ep-05:103","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","t":"Yeoni用力把前蹄踩在地上。","id":"ep-05:104"},{"s":"yeon","x":"talk","t":"好，开始整理。","id":"ep-05:105"},{"s":"n","bg":"islandIn","t":"头顶的花再次亮起绿光。","id":"ep-05:106","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"yeon","x":"talk","t":"你们之中，想保护我的，到这边来。","id":"ep-05:107"},{"s":"n","t":"绿藤在Yeoni右侧开出一条路。红镜片与银镜片并排停在路边。","id":"ep-05:108"},{"s":"yeon","x":"talk","t":"至于总在消磨我的那些。","id":"ep-05:109"},{"s":"n","t":"Yeoni正面望向镜中的Yeoni。","id":"ep-05:110"},{"s":"yeon","x":"talk","t":"留在那里，别动。","id":"ep-05:111"},{"s":"geo","t":"哦？你觉得自己分得清？","id":"ep-05:112"},{"s":"yeon","x":"grin","t":"刚刚大概摸到点门道。不过正确率不保证。","id":"ep-05:113"},{"s":"geo","t":"错了呢？","id":"ep-05:114"},{"s":"yeon","x":"grin","t":"错了就再学呗。我本来就是重修专业户。","id":"ep-05:115"},{"s":"yeon","im":true,"x":"talk","t":"我不是每次都能选得完美的人。可现在，我不会再随便把任何声音都当成自己的声音。","id":"ep-05:116","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"s":"n","bgm":"crisis2","fx":"veil","t":"随着这句话，[乙亥]之光浮在Yeoni面前。绿芽在深水上扎根。水虽暗却清澈，芽虽小却坚韧。","id":"ep-05:117","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"veil","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","t":"Yeoni朝那道光伸出前蹄。","id":"ep-05:118"},{"s":"geo","t":"不行！","id":"ep-05:119"},{"s":"n","bg":"islandIn","fx":"hands","tone":"dark","t":"镜中的Yeoni挥手，比较、勉强笑、自贬的Yeoni的镜片聚成一团。一只黑玻璃巨手诞生了，试图将[乙亥]整个攥住。","id":"ep-05:120","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"hands","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"neo","x":"serious","t":"Yeoni。","id":"ep-05:121"},{"s":"yeon","x":"surprise","t":"知道，我看到了！","id":"ep-05:122"},{"s":"yeon","x":"surprise","t":"小芽，撑住！只要三秒！","id":"ep-05:123"},{"s":"neo","x":"deadpan","t":"……你真打算把名字定成这个？","id":"ep-05:124"},{"s":"yeon","x":"surprise","t":"起名以后再说，现在很急啊！","id":"ep-05:125"},{"s":"n","bg":"islandIn","fx":"burst","t":"绿藤如爆炸般伸展，将黑玻璃手缠了一圈又一圈。可手太大了，藤蔓被绷得笔直，嘎吱作响，仿佛就要断开。","id":"ep-05:126","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"burst","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","t":"Yeoni被推得向后滑，前蹄刮过地面。","id":"ep-05:127"},{"s":"yeon","x":"surprise","t":"哇啊，力气差距真的假的！做个平衡补丁吧！","id":"ep-05:128"},{"s":"geo","t":"看吧，到头来你还是弱，一直都这样。","id":"ep-05:129"},{"s":"yeon","x":"talk","t":"弱和输，是完全不同的两回事好吗？","id":"ep-05:130"},{"s":"n","t":"这时，[亥]的水动了。深水流入藤蔓根部，从下方托住根。藤蔓变粗，绿光渗入蓝色。","id":"ep-05:131"},{"s":"neo","im":true,"x":"serious","t":"乙亥连上了！就是现在，Yeoni！","id":"ep-05:132","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 neo의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"s":"n","t":"Yeoni将伸出的前蹄狠狠落下。","id":"ep-05:133"},{"s":"yeon","x":"talk","t":"从我的位置上，滚出去！","id":"ep-05:134"},{"s":"n","fx":"claw","t":"藤蔓勒紧黑玻璃手。锵。手背裂开细纹。镜中的Yeoni第一次脸色僵硬。","id":"ep-05:135","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"claw","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"yeon","x":"talk","t":"我会动摇，没错！我承认！","id":"ep-05:136"},{"s":"n","t":"锵。裂纹如蛛网蔓延。","id":"ep-05:137"},{"s":"yeon","im":true,"x":"talk","t":"可我会动摇，不代表你就能代替我活啊！","id":"ep-05:138","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"s":"n","fx":"burst","t":"哗啦！黑玻璃手碎成无数片。比较、勉强笑、自贬的Yeoni的镜子一同破碎，碎片化作黑尘散去。","id":"ep-05:139","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"burst","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","t":"只剩下几块。愤怒Yeoni的红片，说可以休息的银片，还有刚刚诞生的小蓝片。","id":"ep-05:140"},{"s":"neo","x":"soft","t":"……做得好，真心的。","id":"ep-05:141"},{"s":"yeon","x":"grin","t":"我刚才真的做得很好，对吧？再确认一下给我听。","id":"ep-05:142"},{"s":"neo","x":"smile","t":"嗯，做得很好。","id":"ep-05:143"},{"s":"yeon","x":"happy","t":"好，这一刻存个档。这种高光，我人生里不常有。","id":"ep-05:144"},{"s":"n","t":"感动得高举前蹄的瞬间，短后腿失去平衡，噗地向旁边栽倒。帅气只维持了三句话，到此为止。","id":"ep-05:145"},{"s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi默默摇头。就在这时，回廊中央再次浮现文字。","id":"ep-05:146"},{"s":"sys","t":"[ 比肩分类完成 ]\n[ 劫财净化进行中 ]\n[ 乙亥日柱回收率87% ]","id":"ep-05:147"},{"s":"yeon","x":"surprise","t":"等等，为什么不是100%？我刚才不是通关了吗！","id":"ep-05:148"},{"s":"n","bg":"islandIn","tone":"dark","t":"镜中的Yeoni慢慢笑了。她还没有消失，若无其事地站在碎镜之上，俯视着Yeoni。","id":"ep-05:149","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"geo","t":"当然了。","id":"ep-05:150"},{"s":"geo","im":true,"t":"因为最后的劫财，就是我。","id":"ep-05:151","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 geo의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"s":"n","fx":"ink","t":"Yeoni背脊一凉。镜中的Yeoni身后，黑色镜翼彻底展开，每一片羽毛都映着面孔。","id":"ep-05:152","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"ink","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"n","t":"Yeoni羡慕过的脸，暗暗比较过的人，想成为的样子，以及世界上最讨厌的、自己的那些面孔。","id":"ep-05:153"},{"s":"geo","t":"你要赢我，并不是打碎我。","id":"ep-05:154"},{"s":"n","t":"她用指尖指着自己胸口正中。","id":"ep-05:155"},{"s":"geo","im":true,"t":"你得把我带回你心里。","id":"ep-05:156","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 geo의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"s":"yeon","x":"surprise","t":"……什么？那是什么意思。","id":"ep-05:157"},{"s":"geo","t":"因为我是被你丢掉的你。打碎我，你的一部分也会一起消失。","id":"ep-05:158"},{"s":"n","t":"Yeoni想找话反驳，最终却没找到。看向旁边，Yeongnyangi的表情也僵住了。","id":"ep-05:159"},{"s":"neo","x":"talk","t":"Yeoni。","id":"ep-05:160"},{"s":"yeon","x":"calm","t":"……嗯。","id":"ep-05:161"},{"s":"neo","x":"serious","t":"这才是真正的最后一场试炼。","id":"ep-05:162"},{"s":"n","t":"Yeoni望着镜中的自己。人的脸，仿佛毫无破绽的表情，以及蜷缩在那笑容里的夺取之力。劫财。","id":"ep-05:163"},{"s":"yeon","bg":"islandIn","x":"think","t":"好，总结一下……这局就是最终头目战。","id":"ep-05:164","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"steady"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"}},{"s":"geo","t":"没错，现在才发现啊。","id":"ep-05:165"},{"s":"n","t":"整座岛再次剧烈摇晃。最后一行文字浮在回廊上方。","id":"ep-05:166"},{"s":"sys","im":true,"t":"[ 最终劫财战 ]\n[ 找回镜中的自己。 ]","id":"ep-05:167","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 시스템 메시지"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"s":"yeon","x":"talk","t":"找回，说得真轻巧。","id":"ep-05:168"},{"s":"neo","x":"talk","t":"你一逃，她就会把你的位置整个夺走。","id":"ep-05:169"},{"s":"yeon","x":"think","t":"那直接打碎呢？","id":"ep-05:170"},{"s":"neo","x":"talk","t":"如果只打碎，你也会失去自己的一部分。","id":"ep-05:171"},{"s":"yeon","x":"talk","t":"那到底什么才是正确答案？给点提示。","id":"ep-05:172"},{"s":"neo","x":"calm","t":"……让她成为你的一部分。别推开，去拥抱。","id":"ep-05:173"},{"s":"n","t":"Yeoni久久望着镜中的自己。镜中的Yeoni同样回望。一个人，一个花猪。脸完全不同，眼神却比最初更相似了些。","id":"ep-05:174"},{"s":"yeon","x":"soft","t":"我这个人，活得还真够费劲。","id":"ep-05:175"},{"s":"geo","t":"……就是说啊。","id":"ep-05:176"},{"s":"n","t":"这次的回答没有嘲笑。极短的一瞬，真的只是一眨眼。像同一个人，分担着同一份疲惫的表情。","id":"ep-05:177"},{"s":"n","bg":"islandIn","fx":"burst","tone":"dark","t":"下一刻，镜中的Yeoni张开黑翼，朝Yeoni扑来。","id":"ep-05:178","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"burst","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"sys","im":true,"t":"[ 比劫之岛最终战开始 ]","id":"ep-05:179","scene":{"background":"islandIn","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: islandIn","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"islandIn 배경에서 진행되는 시스템 메시지"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}}]}
